{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111788","id":2926736397,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ucnQN","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111788","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111788.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111788.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111788","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111788/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111788/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111788/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d5ab8150852f285d0a62a4b7aebe0ed05871838d","number":111788,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add signals to scrollbar increment/decrement buttons","user":{"login":"robob27","id":2104555,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDQ1NTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2104555?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robob27","html_url":"https://github.com/robob27","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robob27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robob27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robob27/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robob27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robob27/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robob27/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robob27/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robob27/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robob27/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\r\nAdd signals to scrollbar increment/decrement button press/release:\r\n- `increment_pressed`\r\n- `increment_released`\r\n- `decrement_pressed`\r\n- `decrement_released`\r\n\r\n## Why\r\nI wanted to detect when these buttons were being held so that I could auto repeat scrolling on a scrollbar\r\n\r\n## Alternatives Considered\r\nI thought about implementing a feature to even more easily configure auto repeat scroll for these buttons e.g. somewhere in inspector with a checkbox and inputs for initial delay/repeat interval but decided on this approach for now because:\r\n- it enables more than just auto repeat scrolling\r\n- implementing auto repeat scrolling on click of these buttons is super easy with this anyways\r\n- it's a much easier change to make! if the inspector scroll auto repeat stuff still sounds valuable I can create an issue and work on it at some point.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-10-18T12:17:18Z","updated_at":"2025-12-17T19:20:18Z","closed_at":"2025-12-17T19:14:24Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"0e284a51a43cf7b38d9e90662a629d5187db0f59","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"robob27:inc-dec-signals","ref":"inc-dec-signals","repo":{"id":1074671226,"node_id":"R_kgDOQA4ueg","name":"godot","full_name":"robob27/godot","owner":{"login":"robob27",